  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Lequel, laquelle",
     "texto": [
      "They agree with what they replace: **lequel** (masculine singular), **laquelle** (feminine singular), **lesquels** and **lesquelles** (plural).",
      "Example: **La maison dans laquelle tu habites est jolie** (the house in which you live is nice)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Forms with «à» and «de»",
     "texto": [
      "Only some forms contract: **à + lequel = auquel**, **à + lesquels = auxquels**, **à + lesquelles = auxquelles**; **à laquelle** does not contract. With **de**: **duquel**, **desquels**, **desquelles**, but **de laquelle** does not contract."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Dont» or «duquel»",
     "texto": [
      "If the verb requires **de**, **dont** is normally used: **le sujet dont je parle** (the topic I talk about). **Duquel / de laquelle** appears mainly after a compound preposition: **le bâtiment près duquel j'habite** (the building near which I live)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
